It started as a single-axis DIY wheel project and has expanded into two distinct product lines: the DIY Force Feedback Wheel and the FFBeast Active Flight Controls (a full force feedback joystick for flight sim). The site now has a full shop, two separate software applications, and a licensed premium tier.

