FFBeast started as a single hoverboard motor wheel project and has expanded into a full dual-product ecosystem: the DIY FF Wheel and the Active Flight Controls joystick. There's now a shop, two separate software apps, a premium license tier, and a massive community of builders on Discord and Printables.

