Hardware Layer — Controllers

Confirmed compatible boards: original ODrive 3.6, Makerbase XDrive Dual Axis, Makerbase XDrive Single Axis, ODESC 3.6, single-axis ODESC 3.6/4.0, and single-axis ODESC 4.2. All are based on the ODrive 3.6 schematic with minor variations. 
