Here's the honest problem regardless:

The M18 brushless motors across all tools — drill, grinder, Hackzall — share the same fundamental issue for FFB:

11,000 RPM no load on the angle grinder. That's an extremely high KV inrunner. Confirmed 800W at 18V means roughly 44A, KV = 11,000/18 = ~611 RPM/V.

